sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Producer app
    participant Conv as SchemaAwareMessageConverter
    participant Res as SchemaResolver (Caffeine)
    participant Reg as Apicurio Registry
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant CSup as EventConsumerSupport
    participant CApp as Consumer handler

    Note over App,MQ: PRODUCE — toMessage()
    App->>Conv: publish(OrderCreated)
    Conv->>Conv: TypeMappingRegistry lookup (Java type &#8594; coordinates)
    Conv->>Res: resolve(coordinates)
    Res->>Reg: fetch schema (cache miss)
    Reg-->>Res: schema + globalId
    Conv->>Conv: validate payload (strategy)
    Conv->>Conv: serialize (Protobuf / JSON)
    Conv->>MQ: raw bytes + X-Schema-* headers
    Note right of Conv: validation failure &#8594;<br/>SchemaValidationException,<br/>NO message emitted

    Note over MQ,CApp: CONSUME — fromMessage()
    MQ->>CSup: delivery (bytes + headers)
    CSup->>Res: resolve (prefer X-Schema-GlobalId)
    Res-->>CSup: schema (cache hit / stale-on-outage)
    CSup->>CSup: dispatch to SerializationStrategy
    CSup->>CApp: typed OrderCreated object
